{
  "name": "EduGuard AI - Grade Publication Notification",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "eduguard-assessment",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseCode": 200
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-event",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.event }}",
              "rightValue": "grade_published",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "condition-published",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.published }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-grade-published",
      "name": "Filter: Grade Published",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body;\nconst score = body.final_score;\nconst maxScore = 20;\nconst percentage = Math.round((score / maxScore) * 100);\n\nlet grade;\nif (percentage >= 90) grade = 'A';\nelse if (percentage >= 80) grade = 'B';\nelse if (percentage >= 70) grade = 'C';\nelse if (percentage >= 60) grade = 'D';\nelse grade = 'F';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...body,\n    percentage,\n    grade,\n    message: `Grade published: ${score}/${maxScore} (${percentage}%) - Grade: ${grade}`\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "format-message",
      "name": "Format Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_URL || 'http://localhost:8000/api/v1/notifications' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "student_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.student_id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "type",
              "value": "grade_published"
            },
            {
              "name": "title",
              "value": "Grade Published"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.message }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "submission_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.submission_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "send-notification",
      "name": "Send Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [900, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EduGuard AI Notification Pipeline\n\nThis workflow handles grade publication notifications.\n\n**Trigger:** POST to `/webhook/eduguard-assessment`\n\n**Expected payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"grade_published\",\n  \"submission_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"student_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"final_score\": 16,\n  \"published\": true\n}\n```\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Webhook receives grade publication event\n2. Filters for `grade_published` events with `published: true`\n3. Formats the notification message with score and letter grade\n4. Sends notification to the backend",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "documentation",
      "name": "Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 460]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter: Grade Published",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter: Grade Published": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Notification",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Format Notification": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Notification",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "eduguard"
    }
  ],
  "triggerCount": 1
}
